- 引句：Of the forty-eight, six are cities of refuge.
- 引句：The remaining Kohathites (possibly descendants of Moses) get ten cities
- 引句：This final count does not quite fit with the enumeration in 1 Chronicles 6 (1Chr 6:39-66).

## raw_data/biblehub_study_joshua_21.txt
