- 引句：Kibzaim was one of the Ephraimite cities assigned to the Kohathite Levites.
- 引句：Jarmuth lay within Issachar’s inheritance and was assigned to the Gershonite Levites.
- 引句：Mahanaim recalled Jacob’s encounter with God’s angelic hosts, where he named the place “two camps” (Genesis 32:1–2).


